<Base title="App Composer in the Cloudflare dashboard" description="An optional third-party Chrome extension brings Get Ready, Init and decision exploration into your Cloudflare dashboard without collecting credentials."><h1>Keep the work<br/>where you’re working.</h1><p class="lede">An optional Chrome extension opens App Composer’s preparation and configuration workspace directly on the Cloudflare dashboard.</p><section class="section split"><div><h2>One explicit click.</h2><p>The extension uses Manifest V3 and activeTab. It reads no Cloudflare credentials or account fields. Get Ready and Init handoffs go to your existing authorised Codex session; the extension itself cannot deploy.</p><a class="button" href="/downloads/cloudflare-extension.zip" download>Download the extension</a><p class="note">Third-party overlay. Not a Cloudflare feature or partnership. Unpacked distribution; no Chrome Web Store listing is claimed.</p></div><div><h3>Install the local build</h3><ol><li>Unzip the archive.</li><li>Open Chrome’s extension management page and enable developer mode.</li><li>Load the unpacked folder, then open the Cloudflare dashboard.</li><li>Click the App Composer extension action.</li></ol><p>Real installed-dashboard acceptance is a separate gate. <a href="/release">Check the current evidence.</a></p></div></section></Base>
